== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Deathsquitos|Aggressive creature strategies#Deathsquito}}

=== Sting ===
Lunges forward to stab the player with their proboscis (90 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]] damage). This hits in a 1.6-meter 60-degree horizontal arc. It can use this attack every 10 seconds when 1.5 meters from a player.

